          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#kleisli_category Kleisli category
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kleisli+morphisms"} Kleisli morphisms
            of the Giry monad on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Meas"} Meas
            (and related subcategories) are
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Markov+kernels"} Markov kernels
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kleisli+category"} Kleisli category
