                  %mn 0
                  %mo ,
                  %mn ∞
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [0, \infty]
            is not continuous.
          %p
            The Giry monad on Polish spaces uses the weak topology, which is weaker than the weak* topology of the
            = succeed "." do
